#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:5
#: 66c1658535e84368a8bae0ac7c2ed0e5
msgid "Rotoye BatMon Smart Battery"
msgstr "Rotoye BatMon 智能电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:7
#: 63dab9ef84f641d7bb109f981c215b07
msgid ""
"`Rotoye BatMon <https://rotoye.com/>`__ is a smartification kit for off-the-"
"shelf Lithium-Ion and LiPo batteries. It can be purchased as a standalone "
"unit or factory-assembled into a smart-battery."
msgstr ""
"`Rotoye BatMon <https://rotoye.com/>`__ "
"是一款适用于市售锂离子电池和锂聚合物电池的智能化套件，可单独购买或出厂时直接组装成智能电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:18
#: c036f51186db4c47a1a35700b68b33dd
msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:19
#: 0d6ec615fc8848618eb2eecf295f62e2
msgid ""
"Rotoye Batmon uses XT90 connectors with I2C pins built-in. `See Rotoye "
"Tutorials <https://rotoye.com/batmon-tutorial/>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"Rotoye Batmon 使用内置 I2C 引脚的 XT90 连接器。更多详情请参阅 `Rotoye 教程 "
"<https://rotoye.com/batmon-tutorial/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:21
#: 59f03cebc9c14ea898cda1ee37935265
msgid ""
"Multiple BatMon-equipped batteries can be connected, in series, to the same "
"I2C bus using an opto-isolator; `Read more "
"<https://github.com/rotoye/batmon_reader/tree/ArduinoAsMaster/Tutorials/running_multiple_batmons>`__"
msgstr ""
"多个配备 BatMon 的电池可通过光耦隔离器串联连接到同一 I2C 总线；`了解更多 "
"<https://github.com/rotoye/batmon_reader/tree/ArduinoAsMaster/Tutorials/running_multiple_batmons>`__"
